      "id": "claim_afab1b7949e44f96b7fb21442da2dbe2",
      "statement": "profileNameFromArgv() derives the active profile from process.argv (--profile <name> or --profile=<name>) rather than process.cwd(), which is the isolation invariant that keeps a profile's A2A registry from being split into a global-home copy and a profile copy when launched from different directories.",
