      "statement": "loadA2AConfig() reads and validates a2a-agents.json, dropping any agent lacking a string name and a string url and returning a deep copy of DEFAULT_A2A_CONFIG when the file is missing or malformed; saveA2AConfig() mkdir -ps the config dir and writes pretty-printed JSON.",
