    {
      "id": "claim_4085786e67d24fb390657e21ccc013b3",
      "statement": "a2aSendMessage() posts a JSON-RPC message/send request to the endpoint derived by a2aBaseUrl() (which strips /.well-known/agent-card.json and /agent-card.json suffixes and trailing slashes), aborts after 120s, threads an optional contextId into the params, returns { text, contextId }, and extractA2AReply() tolerates both the A2A v0.2 Task shape (result.status.message) and v0.3 direct Message shape (result.message), throwing on an empty or missing reply.",
