      "id": "claim_e31ed16d62a942499f59bde5b8d59f2b",
      "statement": "The inbound message/send handler runTurn() runs a real dsh agent instead of a bespoke prompt: it maps the A2A contextId to the dsh sessionId (a new uuid when absent), resumes or creates the agent on that session, feeds the inbound text via agent.followup(), waits until idle, summarizes the assistant reply and turn reason, and persists the session with sessions.flush() so a later call with the same contextId resumes it after a restart.",
